<xml>
  <block type="device_stepper_driver" x="25" y="25">
    <mutation uid="timer70" />
    <field name="NAME">motor</field>
    <field name="ENGINE">TIMER</field>
    <field name="STEP">9</field>
    <field name="DIR">4</field>
    <field name="SPEED">30000</field>
    <field name="ACCEL">5000</field>
    <field name="DRIVE_MODE">RAMPED</field>
    <field name="DIR_DELAY_US">40</field>
    <comment pinned="false" w="380" h="190">Purpose: Smooth continuous STEP/DIR control using Timer1, without polling pulses from loop. ATmega168/328: STEP=D9 (D10 also supported), DIR=D4. These are MCU signals; follow your driver module input wiring and voltage requirements. Timer1 is unavailable to Servo/PWM/Timer1 interrupt blocks. The sketch starts stopped. Read the Motion guide before connecting a motor.</comment>
  </block>
  <block type="serial_config" x="25" y="360">
    <field name="BAUD">115200</field>
    <comment pinned="false" w="380" h="190">Open Serial Monitor at 115200 baud. Send + or - for small signed speed changes, &gt; or &lt; for larger changes, r to reverse the target, and 0 to ramp to a stop. Newline/CR are ignored.</comment>
  </block>
  <block type="arduino_typed_variable" x="25" y="450">
    <field name="VAR">targetSpeed</field>
    <field name="TYPE">int32_t</field>
    <field name="QUALIFIER">normal</field>
    <value name="VALUE">
      <block type="math_number">
        <field name="NUM">0</field>
      </block>
    </value>
    <comment pinned="false" w="380" h="190">Requested signed speed in driver pulses per second. This is not measured motor speed. Integer steps/s are sufficient here; actual pulse periods are quantized to timer ticks.</comment>
  </block>
  <block type="arduino_setup_section" x="25" y="570">
    <comment pinned="false" w="380" h="190">The device definition initializes Timer1. No movement starts until a nonzero speed command is sent.</comment>
    <statement name="DO">
      <block type="serial_text">
        <field name="TEXT">+/-:10  &lt;&gt;:1000  r:reverse  0:stop</field>
        <field name="END">println</field>
      </block>
    </statement>
  </block>
  <block type="arduino_loop_section" x="500" y="25">
    <comment pinned="false" w="380" h="190">No run block is required for the Timer1 engine. The loop handles commands while the library generates motor pulses. Do not disable interrupts for long periods.</comment>
    <statement name="DO">
      <block type="controls_if">
        <value name="IF0">
          <block type="logic_compare">
            <field name="OP">GT</field>
            <value name="A">
              <block type="serial_available" />
            </value>
            <value name="B">
              <block type="math_number">
                <field name="NUM">0</field>
              </block>
            </value>
          </block>
        </value>
        <statement name="DO0">
          <block type="arduino_typed_variable">
            <field name="VAR">command</field>
            <field name="TYPE">int</field>
            <field name="QUALIFIER">normal</field>
            <value name="VALUE">
              <block type="serial_read" />
            </value>
            <comment pinned="false" w="380" h="190">Read one available byte. This local variable lives only in this if body.</comment>
            <next>
              <block type="controls_if">
                <value name="IF0">
                  <block type="logic_operation">
                    <field name="OP">AND</field>
                    <value name="A">
                      <block type="logic_compare">
                        <field name="OP">NEQ</field>
                        <value name="A">
                          <block type="variables_get">
                            <field name="VAR">command</field>
                          </block>
                        </value>
                        <value name="B">
                          <block type="math_number">
                            <field name="NUM">10</field>
                          </block>
                        </value>
                      </block>
                    </value>
                    <value name="B">
                      <block type="logic_compare">
                        <field name="OP">NEQ</field>
                        <value name="A">
                          <block type="variables_get">
                            <field name="VAR">command</field>
                          </block>
                        </value>
                        <value name="B">
                          <block type="math_number">
                            <field name="NUM">13</field>
                          </block>
                        </value>
                      </block>
                    </value>
                  </block>
                </value>
                <statement name="DO0">
                  <block type="controls_if">
                    <value name="IF0">
                      <block type="logic_compare">
                        <field name="OP">EQ</field>
                        <value name="A">
                          <block type="variables_get">
                            <field name="VAR">command</field>
                          </block>
                        </value>
                        <value name="B">
                          <block type="math_number">
                            <field name="NUM">43</field>
                          </block>
                        </value>
                      </block>
                    </value>
                    <comment pinned="false" w="380" h="190">ASCII 43 is +. Change the target by 10 steps/s. The acceleration setting controls how smoothly the new speed is reached.</comment>
                    <statement name="DO0">
                      <block type="variables_set">
                        <field name="VAR">targetSpeed</field>
                        <value name="VALUE">
                          <block type="math_arithmetic">
                            <field name="OP">ADD</field>
                            <value name="A">
                              <block type="variables_get">
                                <field name="VAR">targetSpeed</field>
                              </block>
                            </value>
                            <value name="B">
                              <block type="math_number">
                                <field name="NUM">10</field>
                              </block>
                            </value>
                          </block>
                        </value>
                      </block>
                    </statement>
                    <next>
                      <block type="controls_if">
                        <value name="IF0">
                          <block type="logic_compare">
                            <field name="OP">EQ</field>
                            <value name="A">
                              <block type="variables_get">
                                <field name="VAR">command</field>
                              </block>
                            </value>
                            <value name="B">
                              <block type="math_number">
                                <field name="NUM">45</field>
                              </block>
                            </value>
                          </block>
                        </value>
                        <comment pinned="false" w="380" h="190">ASCII 45 is -. Change the target by -10 steps/s. The acceleration setting controls how smoothly the new speed is reached.</comment>
                        <statement name="DO0">
                          <block type="variables_set">
                            <field name="VAR">targetSpeed</field>
                            <value name="VALUE">
                              <block type="math_arithmetic">
                                <field name="OP">ADD</field>
                                <value name="A">
                                  <block type="variables_get">
                                    <field name="VAR">targetSpeed</field>
                                  </block>
                                </value>
                                <value name="B">
                                  <block type="math_number">
                                    <field name="NUM">-10</field>
                                  </block>
                                </value>
                              </block>
                            </value>
                          </block>
                        </statement>
                        <next>
                          <block type="controls_if">
                            <value name="IF0">
                              <block type="logic_compare">
                                <field name="OP">EQ</field>
                                <value name="A">
                                  <block type="variables_get">
                                    <field name="VAR">command</field>
                                  </block>
                                </value>
                                <value name="B">
                                  <block type="math_number">
                                    <field name="NUM">62</field>
                                  </block>
                                </value>
                              </block>
                            </value>
                            <comment pinned="false" w="380" h="190">ASCII 62 is &gt;. Change the target by 1000 steps/s. The acceleration setting controls how smoothly the new speed is reached.</comment>
                            <statement name="DO0">
                              <block type="variables_set">
                                <field name="VAR">targetSpeed</field>
                                <value name="VALUE">
                                  <block type="math_arithmetic">
                                    <field name="OP">ADD</field>
                                    <value name="A">
                                      <block type="variables_get">
                                        <field name="VAR">targetSpeed</field>
                                      </block>
                                    </value>
                                    <value name="B">
                                      <block type="math_number">
                                        <field name="NUM">1000</field>
                                      </block>
                                    </value>
                                  </block>
                                </value>
                              </block>
                            </statement>
                            <next>
                              <block type="controls_if">
                                <value name="IF0">
                                  <block type="logic_compare">
                                    <field name="OP">EQ</field>
                                    <value name="A">
                                      <block type="variables_get">
                                        <field name="VAR">command</field>
                                      </block>
                                    </value>
                                    <value name="B">
                                      <block type="math_number">
                                        <field name="NUM">60</field>
                                      </block>
                                    </value>
                                  </block>
                                </value>
                                <comment pinned="false" w="380" h="190">ASCII 60 is &lt;. Change the target by -1000 steps/s. The acceleration setting controls how smoothly the new speed is reached.</comment>
                                <statement name="DO0">
                                  <block type="variables_set">
                                    <field name="VAR">targetSpeed</field>
                                    <value name="VALUE">
                                      <block type="math_arithmetic">
                                        <field name="OP">ADD</field>
                                        <value name="A">
                                          <block type="variables_get">
                                            <field name="VAR">targetSpeed</field>
                                          </block>
                                        </value>
                                        <value name="B">
                                          <block type="math_number">
                                            <field name="NUM">-1000</field>
                                          </block>
                                        </value>
                                      </block>
                                    </value>
                                  </block>
                                </statement>
                                <next>
                                  <block type="controls_if">
                                    <value name="IF0">
                                      <block type="logic_compare">
                                        <field name="OP">EQ</field>
                                        <value name="A">
                                          <block type="variables_get">
                                            <field name="VAR">command</field>
                                          </block>
                                        </value>
                                        <value name="B">
                                          <block type="math_number">
                                            <field name="NUM">114</field>
                                          </block>
                                        </value>
                                      </block>
                                    </value>
                                    <comment pinned="false" w="380" h="190">ASCII 114 is r. The library brakes before reversing direction.</comment>
                                    <statement name="DO0">
                                      <block type="variables_set">
                                        <field name="VAR">targetSpeed</field>
                                        <value name="VALUE">
                                          <block type="math_arithmetic">
                                            <field name="OP">MINUS</field>
                                            <value name="A">
                                              <block type="math_number">
                                                <field name="NUM">0</field>
                                              </block>
                                            </value>
                                            <value name="B">
                                              <block type="variables_get">
                                                <field name="VAR">targetSpeed</field>
                                              </block>
                                            </value>
                                          </block>
                                        </value>
                                      </block>
                                    </statement>
                                    <next>
                                      <block type="controls_if">
                                        <value name="IF0">
                                          <block type="logic_compare">
                                            <field name="OP">EQ</field>
                                            <value name="A">
                                              <block type="variables_get">
                                                <field name="VAR">command</field>
                                              </block>
                                            </value>
                                            <value name="B">
                                              <block type="math_number">
                                                <field name="NUM">48</field>
                                              </block>
                                            </value>
                                          </block>
                                        </value>
                                        <comment pinned="false" w="380" h="190">ASCII 48 is 0. A zero target requests a decelerating stop.</comment>
                                        <statement name="DO0">
                                          <block type="variables_set">
                                            <field name="VAR">targetSpeed</field>
                                            <value name="VALUE">
                                              <block type="math_number">
                                                <field name="NUM">0</field>
                                              </block>
                                            </value>
                                          </block>
                                        </statement>
                                        <next>
                                          <block type="variables_set">
                                            <field name="VAR">targetSpeed</field>
                                            <value name="VALUE">
                                              <block type="math_constrain">
                                                <value name="VALUE">
                                                  <block type="variables_get">
                                                    <field name="VAR">targetSpeed</field>
                                                  </block>
                                                </value>
                                                <value name="LOW">
                                                  <block type="math_number">
                                                    <field name="NUM">-30000</field>
                                                  </block>
                                                </value>
                                                <value name="HIGH">
                                                  <block type="math_number">
                                                    <field name="NUM">30000</field>
                                                  </block>
                                                </value>
                                              </block>
                                            </value>
                                            <next>
                                              <block type="device_stepper_speed">
                                                <field name="DEVICE">timer70</field>
                                                <value name="SPEED">
                                                  <block type="variables_get">
                                                    <field name="VAR">targetSpeed</field>
                                                  </block>
                                                </value>
                                                <comment pinned="false" w="380" h="190">Submit a changed target to the timer engine. It plans acceleration and emits pulses in the background. Repeating an unchanged target does not restart the ramp.</comment>
                                                <next>
                                                  <block type="serial_send">
                                                    <field name="END">println</field>
                                                    <value name="VALUE">
                                                      <block type="variables_get">
                                                        <field name="VAR">targetSpeed</field>
                                                      </block>
                                                    </value>
                                                    <comment pinned="false" w="380" h="190">Print the requested speed only after commands. This avoids flooding Serial. At 30000 steps/s, one 16 MHz timer tick changes the obtainable rate by about 56 steps/s: several tiny requests may map to the same period.</comment>
                                                  </block>
                                                </next>
                                              </block>
                                            </next>
                                          </block>
                                        </next>
                                      </block>
                                    </next>
                                  </block>
                                </next>
                              </block>
                            </next>
                          </block>
                        </next>
                      </block>
                    </next>
                  </block>
                </statement>
              </block>
            </next>
          </block>
        </statement>
      </block>
    </statement>
  </block>
</xml>
